  "technical_note": "Bars 1\u201317 form a palindrome in the LH chord pitches and their durations, with bar 9 at its centre. The melody is newly shaped on the return rather than reversed. Keep each three-note LH chord finger-held through the pedal changes, and let the changing metres follow the phrase. The final RH chord spans a major seventh; all earlier LH shapes fit within a fifth.",
